{
  "dqlnbVersion": 1,
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Claims by region",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Claims by region",
    "description": "Live permission checks: row rules (region), column masking (members.ssn, pii) and the phi tag (claims.diagnosis_code) as each person runs the same cells."
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "markdown",
      "title": "About",
      "source": "# Claims by region\n\nEach person runs the same cells. Row rules decide which regions they see; column policies decide whether SSNs are masked. Used by the live permission checks."
    },
    {
      "id": "claims_by_region",
      "type": "sql",
      "title": "Claims and amount by region",
      "source": "SELECT region, count(*) AS claims, round(sum(claimed_amount), 2) AS claimed_amount\nFROM claims\nGROUP BY region\nORDER BY region"
    },
    {
      "id": "members_sample",
      "type": "sql",
      "title": "Members (masked columns)",
      "source": "SELECT member_id, full_name, ssn, region\nFROM members\nORDER BY member_id\nLIMIT 10"
    },
    {
      "id": "claims_by_diagnosis",
      "type": "sql",
      "title": "Claims by diagnosis (aggregate only)",
      "source": "SELECT diagnosis_code, count(*) AS claims\nFROM claims\nGROUP BY diagnosis_code\nORDER BY claims DESC\nLIMIT 10"
    }
  ]
}
